# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo and check out LF everywhere.
# This project develops on Windows but deploys to a Raspberry Pi / Linux box,
# and CRLF line endings break systemd unit files and shell scripts on Linux.
# Python and JS handle LF fine on Windows, so LF-everywhere is safe.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat these as binary (no line-ending translation, no diffs).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.uf2 binary
